WEBVTT

00:08:59.952 --> 00:09:03.622
That's the size
of the German stock market.

00:09:06.875 --> 00:09:08.419
Now.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.296
What does this tell us?

00:09:10.337 --> 00:09:14.967
This tells us that
a living and thriving nature

00:09:15.009 --> 00:09:18.095
is not only valuable intrinsically,

00:09:18.137 --> 00:09:22.057
it's also financially valuable to us.

00:09:23.934 --> 00:09:26.020
Question is, what do you do with this?

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:29.690
So the science tells us
what a wondrous Earth we are on.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.483
We can value it in dollars and cents.